{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doodle: Defense is an exciting roguelite tower defense game in which you play as a mining vessel defending yourself against the planets inhabitants!\u00a0 Use ink to fire bullets and level up to upgrade yourself and add defenses!\u00a0 Extraction will take 20 minutes, good luck!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does a full release look like?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Weapons:\u00a0</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 weapons - to remain secret for now</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Bosses:\u00a0</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 main bosses which appear every 5 minutes or so</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss upgrades (you get the upgrade, not the boss)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Bases:\u00a0</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different bases with different stats and graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Enemies:\u00a0</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special spawns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Difficulties:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different difficulties for both a harder time and an easier time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game Modes:\u00a0Extremely Optional</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different game modes, unlockable</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game modes are optional to the scope of this project.\u00a0 If they don't happen, just know they either weren't fun enough to release, or were not possible with this project.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customization</u>:<u>\u00a0Extremely Optional</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a huge fan of customizing stuff in games so a possible goal is to allow customizing units/bosses/bases/backgrounds with your own assets or choosing colors.\u00a0 Definitely depends on time/motivation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Achievements</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Controller Support</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Steam Deck Support?</u></strong>\u00a0(This is a maybe because the behavior of some enemies may not work on such a small screen)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3901530?t=1755615991","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3901530?t=1755615991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901530/d74765b29328da0fa4813c5766ba2970507be7de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755615991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901530/d74765b29328da0fa4813c5766ba2970507be7de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755615991","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3909110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doodle: Defense is an exciting roguelite tower defense game in which you play as a mining vessel defending yourself against the planets inhabitants!\u00a0 Use ink to fire bullets and level up to upgrade yourself and add defenses!\u00a0 Extraction will take 20 minutes, good luck!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does a full release look like?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Weapons:\u00a0</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 weapons - to remain secret for now</p></li></u